      Theme.AppCompat.NoActionBar because MainActivity now extends
      AppCompatActivity (CloudStream plugins cast the load() Context to
      androidx.appcompat.app.AppCompatActivity — the ClassCastException device
      report). AppCompat themes resolve to the same android:Theme.Material
      platform theme on API 21+, and every visual attribute is pinned
      explicitly below, so rendering is unchanged. Required by AppCompatActivity
      ("You need to use a Theme.AppCompat theme").
    -->
    <style name="Theme.ANIKUTA" parent="Theme.AppCompat.NoActionBar">
        <item name="android:windowBackground">#14111F</item>
        <item name="android:statusBarColor">#14111F</item>
        <item name="android:navigationBarColor">#14111F</item>
    </style>
</resources>
